SUMMARY:INTU — Call #2
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: INTUIT INC (INTU)\nRoadshow: https://markets.jpmorgan.com/event_bo
 oking/loadEvent?eventToken=136221_d3e6ad53-ebc7-40a4-be84-cf2b729ed616\n\n
 Deal context:\nIntuit Inc (INTU)\, rated A3/Stable (Moody's) and A/Stable 
 (S&P)\, is bringing a two-tranche SEC-registered senior unsecured benchmar
 k offering consisting of a 5-year (due June 15\, 2031) and a 10-year (due 
 June 15\, 2036)\, both with make-whole calls and par calls (1 month and 3 
 months prior to maturity\, respectively). Initial price talk is T+100 area
  on the 5-year and T+125 area on the 10-year\, with proceeds intended for 
 general corporate purposes including potential refinancing of the $750mm 5
 .25% Notes due 2026 and the $500mm 1.35% Notes due 2027. The deal is expec
 ted to price today (June 8\, 2026) with T+3 settlement on June 11\, 2026\,
  with BofA acting as B&D on the 5-year and JPM acting as B&D on the 10-yea
 r\, alongside SCOTIA as a joint bookrunner on both tranches.
